# BlindTag — Environment Variable Template
#
# Copy this file to .env and populate values as needed.
# .env is gitignored and must NEVER be committed.
#
# Currently BlindTag has no required secrets at runtime.
# This file exists to establish the pattern for future additions
# (e.g., API authentication tokens, signing keys).
#
# ─── Future additions ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# BLINDTAG_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
# BLINDTAG_SIGNING_KEY_PATH=/path/to/signing.key
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
